---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const services=[['Web development','Modern websites, custom WordPress experiences and purpose-built web applications.'],['SEO & content systems','Technical SEO, site architecture, Search Console analysis and search-led content planning.'],['Google Ads & measurement','Campaign support, conversion tracking, Google Tag Manager and GA4 event auditing.'],['Digital operations','Internal dashboards, task workflows and automation that support growing teams.']];
---
<Base title="Services | Local Presence 360"><section class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">CAPABILITIES</div><h1 class="page-title">Build the experience. Measure the outcome.</h1><p class="lead">A practical blend of development, search marketing and digital operations.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr))">{services.map(([name,desc],i)=><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">0{i+1} / SPECIALTY</div><h3>{name}</h3><p>{desc}</p></div></div>)}</div></section><section class="section alt"><div class="wrap cta"><h2>Not sure which service fits?</h2><p>Tell me what you're trying to achieve. I can help break down the technical and marketing pieces.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Start a conversation ↗</a></div></section></Base>